ion":[0,0,0],"color":0,"children":["98b2b6f4-3f8f-e0b4-f8dd-557bc5a891c8","81fcab9c-71d4-074d-086b-05fe9b3cb451","4f14066a-a121-9fcb-aea8-6c6d242ae067","45efa7c7-1a02-5cd0-de12-97e8dd3ad59a","4d828af0-d063-eb3c-b854-bec6d88d1ba0"],"reset":false,"shade":true,"mirror_uv":false,"autouv":0,"isOpen":false,"primary_selected":false},"6a7d993c-c545-ccfa-a0ec-307eadb77278"],"reset":false,"shade":true,"mirror_uv":false,"autouv":0,"isOpen":false,"primary_selected":false},"ddcc9ee0-d969-f6bb-c06c-bbada940b3d0"],"reset":false,"shade":true,"mirror_uv":false,"autouv":0,"isOpen":false,"primary_selected":false}],"reset":false,"shade":true,"mirror_uv":false,"autouv":0,"isOpen":false,"primary_selected":false}],"textures":[{"name":"robe_flamecaller.png","path":"","relative_path":"","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","group":"","scope":0,"width":128,"height":64,"uv_width":128,"uv_height":64,"particle":false,"use_as_default":false,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","file_format":"png","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","wrap_mode":"limited","pbr_channel":"color","fps":7,"frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":false,"uuid":"b9350c3f-c13b-8102-748a-c9196e4a7d70","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"description":"## robe_flamecaller\n\nRobe, worn by mages (Patch 7 loot).\n\n- Cubes: 22 (0 rotated). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -9.8..9.8, y 4.7..49.6, z -4.9..4.6 (size 19.6 x 44.9 x 9.6 u = 55 x 126 x 27 cm).\nThe flamecaller's robe with its burning hem (`flamecaller.bbmodel`: `chest`, `collar`, `robe_skirt`, `robe_hem_r/l`, the arms and the `sleeve_r/l` cuffs, `glow_hem_r/l`), redrawn as a mage's robe to fit mage_base, one look on every mage: the robe over the torso, the bust and both arms; the skirt on `hips`, over the mage's own skirt; and the lower robe on the thighs (`leg_upper_r/l`) and shins (`leg_lower_r/l`), so the legs never cut through it. Every face is resampled from the monster's own texture at 1 px per unit, so the colours and pixel style are its own. Same bones and pivots as mage_base. Patch 7 loot. The burning hem is `glow_hem_r/l` round the bottom with three small flame tongues per leg (`glow_flame_*`), all glowing cubes.\n"}